# VIDLIX

Inspect the repository before changing code. Prefer small modular changes. Reuse the design system.

Phase 1 only: Instagram + Facebook. No AI, WhatsApp, YouTube, scraping, or password collection.

Staging and production secrets, databases, Redis, storage, Meta apps, and Razorpay keys stay isolated.

Do not invent Meta API capabilities, legal entity facts, customers, or testimonials.

Automations must remain testable before activation. Webhooks must stay idempotent.

After substantial changes: tests, lint, typecheck. Document architecture in BRAIN.md without pasting large source.
